static const char __pyx_k_Models_dev_registry_integration[] = "Models.dev registry integration \342\200\224 primary database for providers and models.\n\nFetches from https://models.dev/api.json \342\200\224 a community-maintained database\nof 4000+ models across 109+ providers.  Provides:\n\n- **Provider metadata**: name, base URL, env vars, documentation link\n- **Model metadata**: context window, max output, cost/M tokens, capabilities\n  (reasoning, tools, vision, PDF, audio), modalities, knowledge cutoff,\n  open-weights flag, family grouping, deprecation status\n\nData resolution order (like TypeScript OpenCode):\n  1. Bundled snapshot (ships with the package \342\200\224 offline-first)\n  2. Disk cache (~/.hermes/models_dev_cache.json)\n  3. Network fetch (https://models.dev/api.json)\n  4. Background refresh every 60 minutes\n\nOther modules should import the dataclasses and query functions from here\nrather than parsing the raw JSON themselves.\n";
